### 2.1.2 Decentralization Evidence

_Table 3: Decentralization Features_

| Feature                    | Implementation               | Proof                                            |
| -------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| Immutable Vote Storage     | Votes recorded on blockchain | Smart contract `batchVote()` function            |
| No Single Point of Failure | Distributed network          | Hoodi Testnet deployment                         |
| Transparent Vote Counting  | Publicly verifiable          | `getCandidatesForCategory()` returns vote counts |
| Admin Cannot Modify Votes  | Blockchain immutability      | Once recorded, votes cannot be changed           |

**Code Evidence:**

```solidity
// File: src/contracts/VotingSystem.sol (Lines 450-489)
function batchVote(VoteChoice[] memory votes) external {
    v.votedInCategory[categoryId] = true;
    c.voteCount++;
    emit VoteCast(msg.sender, categoryId, candidateId);
}
```

