# 5. Objective 3 Achievement (CIA Triad)

**Objective:** To ensure the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of voting data (votes and results) by applying proper security principles and mechanisms, thereby fostering trust, transparency, and reliability in the system throughout the voting process.

---

## 5.1 CONFIDENTIALITY

### 5.1.1 Voter Privacy Protection

_Table 19: Confidentiality Mechanisms_

| Mechanism             | Implementation                 | Evidence                          |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------ | --------------------------------- |
| Pseudonymous Voting   | Wallet addresses only on-chain | VotingSystem.sol Voter struct     |
| Password Hashing      | Bcrypt (salt rounds: 10)       | `server/src/utils/otp-helpers.ts` |
| OTP Hashing           | Bcrypt hashing                 | Not stored in plaintext           |
| JWT Tokens            | Session authentication         | 24h expiry                        |
| Environment Variables | Secrets not hardcoded          | `.env.example` file               |

**Code Evidence - Voter Privacy:**

```solidity
// File: src/contracts/VotingSystem.sol (Lines 37-43)
// On-chain: Only wallet address visible (pseudonymous)
struct Voter {
    string studentId;      // NOT on blockchain
    string department;     // NOT on blockchain
    uint256 yearOfStudy;   // NOT on blockchain
    bool isRegistered;     // Public
    mapping(uint256 => bool) votedInCategory;  // Public (but anonymous)
}
```

**Code Evidence - OTP Hashing:**

```typescript
// File: server/src/utils/otp-helpers.ts
const hashedOTP = await bcrypt.hash(otp, 10);
```

**Code Evidence - Password Hashing:**

```typescript
// Bcrypt hashing (salt rounds: 10)
const passwordHash = await bcrypt.hash(password, 10);
```

**Code Evidence - JWT Tokens:**

```typescript
// JWT tokens for authentication
const token = jwt.sign({ email, studentId }, JWT_SECRET, { expiresIn: "24h" });
```

### 5.1.2 Database Security

**Code Evidence - Sensitive Data Protection:**

```sql
-- File: database/Tables creation.sql
CREATE TABLE voters (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    student_id VARCHAR(20) UNIQUE,  -- Private
    email VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE,       -- Private
    wallet_address VARCHAR(42),      -- Public (pseudonymous)
    email_otp_hash TEXT              -- Hashed, not plaintext
);
```

### 5.1.3 Security Improvements

_Table 20: Security Improvements (from SECURITY_SETUP.md)_

| Improvement         | Before           | After                | Evidence                       |
| ------------------- | ---------------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Hardcoded Secrets   | Present          | Removed              | Environment variables          |
| X-Powered-By Header | Enabled          | Disabled             | `server/src/index.ts`          |
| Database Password   | Default fallback | Required env var     | `server/src/db.ts`             |
| Admin Credentials   | Hardcoded        | Environment variable | `server/scripts/seed-admin.ts` |
| Security Score      | 35% (21 issues)  | 65% (11 issues)      | Snyk scan results              |

