## 5.2 INTEGRITY

### 5.2.1 Blockchain Immutability

**Code Evidence - Immutable Votes:**

```solidity
// File: src/contracts/VotingSystem.sol (Lines 450-489)
// Votes cannot be changed after recording
function batchVote(VoteChoice[] memory votes) external {
    c.voteCount++;  // Permanent increment
    emit VoteCast(msg.sender, categoryId, candidateId);  // Permanent log
}
```

