### Objective 2: User Interface

- ✅ 15+ user-friendly pages implemented
- ✅ Complete registration, voting, and verification flows
- ✅ Real-time results and vote receipts
- ✅ Responsive design (mobile, tablet, desktop)

### Objective 3: Security (CIA Triad)

- ✅ **Confidentiality:** Bcrypt hashing, JWT tokens, pseudonymous voting, environment variables
- ✅ **Integrity:** Blockchain immutability, double-voting prevention (2 layers), transaction verification, database constraints, input validation, audit logging
- ✅ **Availability:** Distributed network, auto-end mechanism, emergency controls, load testing, error handling, connection pooling, system reset

### Objective 4: Evaluation

- ✅ **Security:** Snyk scan (35% → 65%), smart contract security, authentication security
- ✅ **Performance:** Artillery load testing, <500ms response times, 10+ concurrent users, batch voting optimization
- ✅ **Usability:** User-friendly interfaces, responsive design, clear feedback, comprehensive admin dashboard
- ✅ **Simulation:** Complete election lifecycle tested, multi-category voting verified, system reset validated

